# COMMODITY ADMIN AI — FINAL DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

PROJECT NAME: Commodity_Admin_AI
PROMPT FILE: commodityAi


==================================================
PROJECT OBJECTIVE
==================================================

Build an Admin-only AI chatbot for the B2B Commodity Raw Material Marketplace.

The chatbot will allow an authorized Admin to ask questions about marketplace data and knowledge using natural language.

The Admin can communicate using:

1. English
2. Marathi
3. Hindi

The Admin can enter questions using:

1. Keyboard
2. Microphone / Speech-to-Text

The chatbot must use:

- Spring Boot
- Java 17
- Spring AI
- Google Gemini
- Google Gemini Embedding
- PostgreSQL
- PGVector
- RAG
- Controlled Backend REST APIs
- HTTP/JSON communication

The chatbot is READ-ONLY in Phase 1.


==================================================
