==================================================
PGVECTOR ARCHITECTURE
==================================================

Use ONE PGVector system in the Chatbot project.

PGVector can contain two logical categories of searchable information.

CATEGORY 1 — KNOWLEDGE / RAG DATA

Examples:

- Commodity information
- Documents
- FAQs
- Business rules
- Marketplace documentation
- General commodity knowledge
- Other approved knowledge documents


CATEGORY 2 — INDEXED MARKETPLACE DATA

Examples:

- Current market rates
- Rate history
- Buyer demands
- Listings
- Commodities
- Notifications
- WhatsApp logs
- Other approved marketplace information

Use metadata to distinguish data types where appropriate.

For example:

type = KNOWLEDGE

or

type = MARKETPLACE_DATA


IMPORTANT:

PGVector is NOT the source of truth for marketplace transactions.

Marketplace PostgreSQL remains the source of truth.

PGVector contains a searchable/indexed representation of approved data for AI retrieval.


